<title>GERMANY: Issing says Issing not planning repo rate change.</title>
<headline>Issing says Issing not planning repo rate change.</headline>
<dateline>FRANKFURT 1997-06-06</dateline>
<text>
<p>Bundesbank chief economist Otmar Issing said on Friday the central bank was not planning to ease its main money market rate despite unsually high liquidity at the end of May which had fanned such speculation.</p>
<p>&quot;The surge in liquidity at the end of May is not an indication that a repo rate easing is on the way,&quot; Issing told a conference.</p>
</text>
